          "timestamp": "2026-07-30T10:00:09.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 323
        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "If AMD’s share price rises to the $600-700 range – the capital cost for the GPUs only will effectively be zero for both! If AMD continues to make strides improving their software stack and winning large customer orders and sees their share price increase above $1,000 – then this",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2084278535640830193",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-03T22:01:41.000+08:00",
